{"ok":true,"data":"Editor test case T6_MemberCompletionHidesEmptyLine \ndescription: completion on an empty line offers alert, channel, threshold and # only; threshold creates a threshold \nbefore: alert book Ops \n  channel pager -> pager://ops \n  <cell > \nresult: alert book Ops \n  channel pager -> pager://ops \n  threshold <no name> =      \ncode: \n  invoke action -> Complete \n  final EditorComponent ec = editor component; \n  final List<String> items = new  ArrayList<String>(); \n  SwingUtilities.invokeAndWait({ => ec.getEditorContext().getRepository().getModelAccess().runReadAction({ => { \n        for (SubstituteAction a : ec.getSelectedCell().getSubstituteInfo().getMatchingActions(\"\", false)) { \n          items.add(a.getMatchingText(\"\")); \n        } \n      } }); }); \n  Collections.sort(items); \n  Assert.assertEquals(Arrays.asList(\"#\", \"alert\", \"channel\", \"threshold\"), items); \n  type \"threshold\" \n  press keys <any>+<VK_ENTER> replace all ;"}

