{"ok":true,"data":"Editor test case T7_CompactBookTypeAlertName \ndescription: in a compact book an alert is one line without its condition; typing at the end of its name extends the name and leaves the caret at the end of the name \nbefore: alert book Ops \n  <cell alert HighCpu [high]> \nresult: alert book Ops \n  <cell alert HighCpuX [high]> \ncode: \n  EditorComponent ec = editor component; \n  Assert.assertEquals(\"an alert of a compact book is one line without its condition\", Arrays.asList(\"alert\", \"HighCpu\", \"[\", \"high\", \"]\"), CompactViewTestUtil.memberLabels(ec, \"HighCpu\")); \n  type \"X\""}

