{"ok":true,"data":"Editor test case T8_CompactBookHidesCondition \ndescription: an alert of a normal book shows its condition; once the book is marked compact the condition is no longer shown and the alert is one line \nbefore: alert book Ops \n  <cell alert HighCpu [high] when cpu > 90> \nresult: alert book Ops \n  alert HighCpu [high] \ncode: \n  EditorComponent ec = editor component; \n  Assert.assertTrue(\"an alert of a normal book shows its condition\", CompactViewTestUtil.isChildShown(ec, \"HighCpu\", \"condition\")); \n  CompactViewTestUtil.setRootProperty(ec, \"compact\", \"true\"); \n  Assert.assertFalse(\"an alert of a compact book shows no condition\", CompactViewTestUtil.isChildShown(ec, \"HighCpu\", \"condition\")); \n  Assert.assertEquals(Arrays.asList(\"alert\", \"HighCpu\", \"[\", \"high\", \"]\"), CompactViewTestUtil.memberLabels(ec, \"HighCpu\"));"}

