{"ok":true,"data":"Editor test case T10_CompactInspectorEditCondition \ndescription: in a compact book the Inspector of an alert shows its condition and channels; typing there edits the condition \nbefore: alert book Ops \n  channel pager -> pager://ops \n  alert HighCpu [high] \nresult: alert book Ops \n  channel pager -> pager://ops \n  alert HighCpu [high] \ncode: \n  EditorComponent ec = editor component; \n  Assert.assertEquals(\"the Inspector shows the alert\", \"HighCpu\", CompactViewTestUtil.editedNodeName(ec)); \n  Assert.assertTrue(\"the Inspector shows the condition\", CompactViewTestUtil.isEditedChildShown(ec, \"condition\")); \n  Assert.assertTrue(\"the Inspector shows the channel list\", CompactViewTestUtil.isEditedChildShown(ec, \"notify\")); \n  type \"5\""}

